{"id": "86130", "name": "חילוק שבר בשבר – תוצאה מצומצמת (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>Calculate</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\({{CT:0}}\\div{{CT:1}} = \\) [[input:ans]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">Make sure to express your answer as a single fraction in its simplest form.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> In order to divide fractions multiply the first fraction by the reciprocal of the second, then simplify.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Multiply by the reciprocal</b><br>The reciprocal of \\({{CT:1}}\\) is \\({{CT:2}}\\) (numerator and denominator swapped). In this example:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}\\div{{CT:1}}={{CT:0}}\\cdot{{CT:2}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Multiply the numerators and the denominators</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}\\cdot{{CT:2}}=\\frac{{{CT:3}}\\cdot {{CT:4}}}{{{CT:5}}\\cdot {{CT:6}}}=\\frac{{{CT:7}}}{{{CT:8}}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Simplify to lowest terms</b><br>[[if test=\"{{CT:11}}\"]]The greatest common divisor of \\({{CT:7}}\\) and \\({{CT:8}}\\) is \\({{CT:9}}\\). Divide the numerator and denominator by \\({{CT:9}}\\):<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{{{CT:7}}}{{{CT:8}}}=\\frac{{{CT:7}}\\div {{CT:9}}}{{{CT:8}}\\div {{CT:9}}}={{CT:10}} \\]</p>[[else]]The greatest common divisor of \\({{CT:7}}\\) and \\({{CT:8}}\\) is \\(1\\), so nothing cancels. [[/if]]The numerator and the denominator now have no common factor (their greatest common divisor is \\(1\\)), so the answer is in lowest terms:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:10}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": false, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "EqualComAss", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "1-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans", "tans": "fa", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-1-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">You've multiplied the fractions by mistake!</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "1-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-2-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer is algebraically equivalent to the correct answer but is not expressed in its simplest terms.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-2-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["A1", "B1", "C1", "D1", "M1", "N1", "a", "b", "c", "d", "fa", "g1", "gA", "gC", "ta"], "nvariants": 50}